          NextDialogue = 6100308,
          RougeTalkActorType = 3,
          Subtitle = "You sit in a tavern at dusk.\nA bard plays his accordion as returning sailors clap and raise their voices in harmony.\nAmid salty sea winds and sweet malt ale, you step into the heart of the crowd and dance—your feet light, your heart lighter."
