          Subtitle = "(No trace of life remains among the soldiers.)"
        },
        [11019417] = {
          ContentFR = "Des carcasses de Souillés jonchent le sol — ce sont ces créatures qui ont fauché la jeunesse des soldats. Mais, jusqu’à leur dernier souffle, ces derniers ont riposté : leurs balles mortelles ont percé les monstres qui les ont emportés.",
          DialogueId = 11019417,
          GUID = "1B9600C8",
          Subtitle = "(The Filthoid corpses nearby tell the tale: it was these beasts that ended them. And yet, even in death, the soldiers did not go quietly — their final rounds left lethal wounds in the Filthoids that claimed them.)"
