          Subtitle = "Never heard of it..."
        },
        [51108024] = {
          ContentFR = "Aethyrie se trouve au sud d’Hyperborea et au nord d’Élysium. Un pays de forêts et d’érudits.",
          DialogueId = 51108024,
          GUID = "7FF18E30",
          NextDialogue = 51108025,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Aethyrie's south of Hyperborea and north of Elysium — a place of vast forests and plenty of scholars."
        },
        [51108025] = {
          ContentFR = "À l’origine, je comptais simplement observer les mœurs de Huaxu. Mais son histoire, ses traditions, sa culture, son art... tout s’est révélé bien plus profond que je ne l’imaginais. Quand je m’en suis rendu compte, plus de dix ans s’étaient déjà écoulés.",
          DialogueId = 51108025,
          GUID = "7FF18E5A",
          NextDialogue = 51108026,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "I came here hoping to study Huaxu's ways — its traditions, customs, all that — but the history, folklore, culture, the arts... everything turned out far richer than I'd expected. Before I realised it, I'd already been here over a decade.",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Talk02_Start"
          }
        },
        [51108026] = {
          ContentFR = "Des étrangers, il en passe beaucoup à Huaxu. Mais ceux qui comprennent réellement ce pays sont rares.",
          DialogueId = 51108026,
          GUID = "7FF18E84",
          NextDialogue = 51108027,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Plenty of foreigners pass through Huaxu, but not many really get the place."
        },
        [51108027] = {
          ContentFR = "Ce que je fais, c’est les aider à s’y adapter plus vite. Après tout, dans un pays étranger, rencontrer quelqu’un qui partage votre statut... c’est plutôt rassurant, non ?",
          DialogueId = 51108027,
          GUID = "7FF18EAE",
          NextDialogue = 51108028,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "So I try to help them find their feet a bit quicker. You know how it is — when you're abroad, bumping into someone who's an outsider like you is strangely comforting, isn't it?",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Talk02_End"
          }
        },
        [51108028] = {
          ContentFR = "Euh... donc vous abordez tous les étrangers qui passent par ici ? C’est votre métier ? Vous êtes une sorte de guide ?",
          DialogueId = 51108028,
          GUID = "7FF18ED8",
          NextDialogue = 51108029,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Uh... so you just talk to every foreigner who walks past? Is that your job? Some kind of guide?"
        },
        [51108029] = {
          ContentFR = "Un métier ? Disons que je sers parfois d’intermédiaire pour des marchands ou des responsables politiques, afin d’éviter des malentendus inutiles. En échange, je reçois une rémunération.",
          DialogueId = 51108029,
          GUID = "7FF18F02",
          NextDialogue = 51108030,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "My job? Well, I do act as a go-between for traders or officials now and then — keeps their conversations from going off the rails. They pay me for that.",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Explain01_Start"
          }
        },
        [51108030] = {
          ContentFR = "Imaginez un Hyperboréen lâchant une remarque maladroite face à un Descendant draconique en pleine négociation... Ou un habitant de Huaxu donnant, au mauvais moment, son avis sur les produits de la mer à quelqu’un venu de Luca. Ce serait fâcheux, vous ne trouvez pas ?",
          DialogueId = 51108030,
          GUID = "7FF18F2C",
          NextDialogue = 51108031,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Think about it: a Hyperborean blurting out something offensive to a Loongscion in a business meeting... or a Huaxu local making a poorly timed remark about seafood to someone from Luca — that could get ugly, right?"
        },
        [51108031] = {
          ContentFR = "Mais rassurez-vous, nous ne sommes pas dans un cadre aussi formel. Si je vous parle aujourd’hui, c’est uniquement par bienveillance. Mon aide est entièrement gratuite.",
          DialogueId = 51108031,
          GUID = "7FF18F56",
          NextDialogue = 51108032,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "But don't worry — this isn't anything like that. I'm talking to you out of goodwill alone. Anything I offer is completely free.",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Explain01_End"
          }
        },
        [51108032] = {
          ContentFR = "Je vous crois... mais j’ai encore du mal à comprendre pourquoi vous iriez aussi loin.",
          DialogueId = 51108032,
          GUID = "7FF18F80",
          NextDialogue = 51108033,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Sorry... I do believe you. I just don't really understand why you'd go this far."
        },
        [51108033] = {
          ContentFR = "Je comprends. Tous ceux qui arrivent ici réagissent ainsi. Moi aussi, à l’époque.",
          DialogueId = 51108033,
          GUID = "7FF18FAA",
          NextDialogue = 51108034,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "I understand. Everyone who first arrives feels the same — I did too.",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Talk01_Start"
          }
        },
        [51108034] = {
          ContentFR = "Mais en discutant avec les habitants, on ressent peu à peu une ouverture singulière... Sous l’influence des Neuf Chapitres de Dafeng, les gens d’ici développent une chaleur et une confiance presque instinctives.",
          DialogueId = 51108034,
          GUID = "7FF18FD4",
          NextDialogue = 51108035,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "But once you actually start speaking to people here, you notice something unique... a sort of openness. Because of the Nine Chapters of Dafeng, people in Huaxu have this instinctive warmth and trust towards strangers."
        },
        [51108035] = {
          ContentFR = "Ce n’est pas une naïveté née de l’ignorance. C’est un choix : offrir sa bienveillance en sachant que l’on ne sera pas lésé.",
          DialogueId = 51108035,
          GUID = "7FF18FFE",
          NextDialogue = 51108036,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "And it isn't naive trust — it's a choice. They choose to extend goodwill, knowing full well they won't come to any harm."
        },
        [51108036] = {
          ContentFR = "Mon pays n’a rien de mauvais, bien sûr. Mais cette atmosphère m’a profondément marqué. C’est ainsi, selon moi, que les peuples d’Atlasia devraient interagir.",
          DialogueId = 51108036,
          GUID = "7FF19028",
          NextDialogue = 51108037,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "I'm not saying my homeland is any worse, but honestly, I was really drawn to that atmosphere. It's how I think people across Atlasia ought to treat one another."
        },
        [51108037] = {
          ContentFR = "J’aimerais transmettre cet état d’esprit à d’autres étrangers, afin qu’ils l’emportent avec eux lorsqu’ils rentreront chez eux. Qui sait ? Peut-être que le monde s’en portera un peu mieux.",
          DialogueId = 51108037,
          GUID = "7FF19052",
          NextDialogue = 51108038,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "So I try to pass that mindset on to foreigners like me — let them bring a bit of it back home and spread it. Maybe the world ends up a little more peaceful.",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Talk01_End"
          }
        },
        [51108038] = {
          ContentFR = "C’est... une vision sacrément ambitieuse...",
          DialogueId = 51108038,
          GUID = "7FF1907C",
          NextDialogue = 51108039,
          SpeakNpcId = 100001,
          Subtitle = "Th—That's... quite a vision."
        },
        [51108039] = {
          ContentFR = "Ha ha ha ! Je ne prétendrai pas être dénué d’intérêt personnel. Si l’Empire et l’Église arrêtaient de se dresser l’un contre l’autre, Aethyrie s’en porterait aussi bien mieux, n’est-ce pas ?",
          DialogueId = 51108039,
          GUID = "7FF190A6",
          NextDialogue = 51108040,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Hah! Well, I'll admit I've got my own reasons too. If the Empire and the Church weren't constantly at each other's throats, Aethyrie — my homeland — would have a much easier time of it, wouldn't it?",
          TalkActionId = {
            [1] = "701008:Talk02_Start"
          }
        },
        [51108040] = {
          ContentFR = "Mais au fond, j’aime simplement transmettre de la bienveillance sans arrière-pensée.",
          DialogueId = 51108040,
          GUID = "7FF190D0",
          NextDialogue = 51108041,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "But honestly? I just enjoy being able to show goodwill without having to worry about any consequences."
        },
        [51108041] = {
          ContentFR = "Tout le monde se croit fondamentalement bon. Alors, lorsqu’on peut le prouver par ses actes, cela procure une certaine satisfaction.",
          DialogueId = 51108041,
          GUID = "7FF190FA",
          NextDialogue = 51108042,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Everyone likes to think they're a good person. And when you can actually prove it through what you do, it feels... rather nice."
        },
        [51108042] = {
          ContentFR = "Certains n’apprécient peut-être pas cette façon de le dire. Mais pour moi, être heureux est essentiel. Et si quelqu’un d’autre peut en bénéficier au passage, c’est encore mieux, non ?",
          DialogueId = 51108042,
          GUID = "7FF19124",
          NextDialogue = 51108043,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "Some people probably wouldn't say it out loud like that, but honestly, I just like feeling good about myself. And if someone else gets a bit of help out of it as well, that's a win in my book — wouldn't you say?"
        },
        [51108043] = {
          ContentFR = "Si vous avez besoin d’aide à Huaxu, venez me voir. Après toutes ces années, j’ai tissé quelques relations — et je ne vous demanderai rien en retour.",
          DialogueId = 51108043,
          GUID = "7FF1914E",
          NextDialogue = 51108044,
          SpeakNpcId = 701008,
          Subtitle = "If you need anything while you're in Huaxu, just come and find me. I've built up quite a few connections over the years — and don't worry, I won't charge you a thing.",
          TalkActionId = {
